00:07:19.644 --> 00:07:21.810
And all they had to do was
upload it to our servers.

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:24.314
They automatically got
incorporated into our modeling.

00:07:24.314 --> 00:07:25.980
They can manually
tune the [? weight, ?]

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:27.980
so that more emphasis
would be placed

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:31.100
on these acoustic
similarity metrics.

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:34.000
And voila, you have
personalized recommendations

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:38.770
with a heavy emphasis on
similar sounding songs.

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:41.745
Another use case, e-commerce,
product recommendations.

00:07:41.745 --> 00:07:42.620
