just one particular metric.

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:20.030
So how much work was all this?

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:21.740
Literally like five minutes.

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:23.720
You drop a beacon, just
like Google Analytics,

00:08:23.720 --> 00:08:26.360
onto your sites, and we
collect all your data.

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:29.060
No need to integrate
us with the CMS.

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:32.750
This JavaScript already
scripts all the content

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:35.360
and creates a real time
snapshot of your entire content

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:36.380
