00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:37.909
No need to dig
into your databases

00:08:37.909 --> 00:08:40.549
to pull out historical
data about your users.

00:08:40.549 --> 00:08:44.480
We collect that all in real
time from the client devices.

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:46.959
And within seven days,
our models are ready.

00:08:46.959 --> 00:08:49.000
And if you want to start
showing recommendations,

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.950
